y\n- list_prefix.py\n- storage_client.py\n- storage_models.py\n- stored_document_ocr.py\n- stored_text_translate.py\n- stored_asset_summary.py\n- asset_metadata_embedding.py\n\nUse write_file for each expected file before producing the final answer.",
